{"seq":4,"slug":"background-jobs-async","title":"后台任务与异步处理","stage":"DONE","category":"backend-engineering","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async","rating":{"composite":3.47,"verdict":"watch","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"后台任务与异步处理-简介\">后台任务与异步处理 简介</h1><p>把耗时、不可靠或可延迟的工作从请求-响应的同步路径剥离出来，是后端服务保持快与稳的关键。本 hub 面向需要构建可靠后台任务系统的工程师，从异步处理的基础（为什么需要后台任务、同步/异步边界、任务队列解剖）讲起，覆盖工作队列与 worker、调度与延迟任务、优先级与公平等队列模式，重试退避、死信队列、幂等消费者等可靠性保证，以及 worker 伸缩、监控告警、毒丸消息等运维实践。贯穿全篇的可靠基线是：at-least-once 投递 + 幂等消费 + 有界重试 + 死信兜底 + 监控告警。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"async-fundamentals","title":"Async Fundamentals","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/async-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-background-jobs","title":"为什么需要后台任务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/async-fundamentals/why-background-jobs"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sync-vs-async-boundaries","title":"同步与异步的边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/async-fundamentals/sync-vs-async-boundaries"},{"seq":3,"slug":"job-queue-anatomy","title":"任务队列的解剖","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/async-fundamentals/job-queue-anatomy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"queue-patterns","title":"Queue Patterns","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/queue-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"task-queues-and-workers","title":"任务队列与工作进程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/queue-patterns/task-queues-and-workers"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scheduling-and-delayed-jobs","title":"调度与延迟任务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/background-jobs-async/queue-patterns/scheduling-and-delayed-jobs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"priority-and-fairness","title":"优先级与公平性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/